        Members are matched by <strong>Club Number → Member ID</strong> first, then <strong>PIN</strong>, then by <strong>name</strong>.
        Social members are excluded (they only exist in CRM). "Playing Ladies" age group is auto-converted based on date of birth.
      </p>

      <form method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <div class="form-group">
