              </svg>
              <span>Sync from HandicapMaster</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content" style="padding: 1.25rem;">
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem;">
              Update all matched CRM members with <strong>Handicap Index</strong>, <strong>Competition Purse</strong>,
